# This directory holds runtime data only (patient records, clinician records,
# audit log, queue state) and is intentionally NOT tracked by git.
#
# Anything in here may contain personal and health information. It must never be
# committed, copied into documentation, or attached to a support ticket.
#
# Production deployments do not use this directory at all: they require
# DATABASE_URL (Postgres). This is the local development store, and its location
# can be overridden with DENTAI_DATA_DIR.
